---
---
<!-- Hero Section -->
<header class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pt-12 pb-24 md:pt-20 md:pb-36 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
    
    <!-- Integração da Logo Vencedora Ampliada + Tipografia Customizada -->
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center mb-10 animate-fade-in">
        <!-- Logo Grande -->
        <div class="w-24 h-24 md:w-32 md:h-32 mb-4 flex items-center justify-center text-custom-main transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105">
            <svg class="w-full h-full animate-pulse-slow" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <rect x="24" y="32" width="12" height="36" rx="3.5" fill="currentColor"/>
                <rect x="44" y="24" width="12" height="52" rx="3.5" class="fill-custom-accent"/>
                <rect x="64" y="32" width="12" height="36" rx="3.5" fill="currentColor"/>
            </svg>
        </div>
        <!-- Escrito SimmerSystems (Simmer em Negrito) -->
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-light tracking-tight text-custom-main mb-2">
            <strong class="font-extrabold tracking-tighter">Simmer</strong>Systems
        </h2>
        <!-- Slogan & Badge de Alta Maturação -->
        <div class="mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-custom-accent/15 text-custom-accent border border-custom-accent/25 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest transition-all">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-custom-accent animate-pulse"></span>
            Solid Systems, Steady Quality
        </div>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-black tracking-tight leading-none max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        O software robusto não é feito à pressa.<br class="hidden md:inline">
        <span class="text-custom-accent">Ele amadurece.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg md:text-xl text-custom-muted max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Substituímos a flexibilidade frágil por regras de negócio estritas. Criamos sistemas consistentes e à prova de falhas humanas para operações jurídicas e administrativas complexas.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/systems" class="px-8 py-4 bg-custom-accent text-custom-main font-bold rounded shadow-lg hover:opacity-95 transition-all-custom cursor-pointer">
            Ver Sistemas, Regras & Custos
        </a>
        <a href="#simulador" class="px-8 py-4 border border-custom bg-custom-surface hover:bg-custom-card font-bold rounded transition-all-custom cursor-pointer">
            Testar Simulador Axiom
        </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-4 text-xs italic text-custom-muted">
        "Solid Systems, Steady Quality" — O Manifesto Simmer.
    </div>
</header>
